> f(x: u8) = x << 8
> domain f
domain of f:
  x: u8, 0..255
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  defined at 0 of 256 points
  undefined e.g. at x=0; x=1; x=2; x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 256 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  empty (undefined everywhere)
  undefined at 256 points
  over all 256 points of the domain
> wrap f
wrap analysis of f:
  x << 8   (u8)
      nuw holds
      nsw holds
  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 0 points, e.g. 
  over all 256 points of the domain
> equiv f f
f and f are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
